nked an object that already existed\nin the content store but was not linked to the current repo whenever the\ntoken's user could access it in another repo. Deploy-key tokens carry\nthe repo owner's identity, so a single-repo write deploy key could link\nand then download objects from any repo the owner can see.\n\nThis drops the cross-repo access check: the batch handler now makes the\nclient upload (hash-verified) any object not yet linked to the repo, and\nthe upload handler skips proof of possession only when the object is\nalready linked to the current repo.","tree":{"sha":"92c3423a5f00a188a9b7194144900a3d5cb2c47e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/git/trees/92c3423a5f00a188a9b7194144900a3d5cb2c47e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/git/commits/66a3723cbb1d2224be9dc62483902b6b2df226c0","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUBXsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvRwQAAOquiiC22bPgUwRGLtK0V/P\nx0zP11X1o6Xd14bnzitwFOMRINRdMPeXutqf48fZr33QWOJ92Y4UYVnxmDhvrnNZ\nBrxrglhIQXZrcC6m5V9gVTBxpu+M6xGSZCxVqO+U52Inp5lnTIK7JPU3kBS+BctB\nMUS4sbuhDpixzeWmrIphsTzqDLwFpJM8b3zcyUl293bJ7SFM7eOruoSa703rtFum\nZnUQif/5uxXEm7h8+8TNhLFjPzPuIJkf5KdnFfK+r8qvBBHPHCGp/6aRBBosbFcC\nXPL5uUY2HGNwjoeI95+o7UFkKkydrGLTros+nLT7fFxz+4jqjq1WFng/bieyjuLM\nzKpc3cfwelRoGp+oZhUpv9N1rrgUZg1fG+DeFHSf1VHL9UlYZoEjiApfA7BtP9OH\ngMW0o7Zo+AlOxWfrS7bnykJF5cckrCzw3aZL3FhvbBY6zEdk0KADTj0HBiSi4voO\nVN5OhSDQv3YuSWBobipO+5Wx04NpSMV/qnBojYBmK4DtGId2e4I8UL6nfUsYyOnT\ntfzugsZWwEgnok5LOPNqw7iqEowx9KRZHdLHtFTXaZR19uUGT1dk7i3KTakCiW0c\nr3JVSkLFfxQuD/jSAvRGJd+GsQKdkFI1p8Xyd+MfUoHTZj0ApHrvlf8CMJHgleox\nDSfzoGW/a7OoVvGVQ0i/\n=LR6j\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 92c3423a5f00a188a9b7194144900a3d5cb2c47e\nparent 27e33b7ba1cbf9eeede88d9709ae71b5c1f18798\nauthor bircni <bircni@icloud.com> 1783633388 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783633388 +0000\n\nfix(lfs): require proof of possession for cross-repo objects (#38322)\n\nThe LFS batch and upload handlers linked an object that already existed\nin the content store but was not linked to the current repo whenever the\ntoken's user could access it in another repo. Deploy-key tokens carry\nthe repo owner's identity, so a single-repo write deploy key could link\nand then download objects from any repo the owner can see.\n\nThis drops the cross-repo access check: the batch handler now makes the\nclient upload (hash-verified) any object not yet linked to the repo, and\nthe upload handler skips proof of possession only when the object is\nalready linked to the current repo.","verified_at":"2026-07-09T21:43:09Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/commits/66a3723cbb1d2224be9dc62483902b6b2df226c0","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/commit/66a3723cbb1d2224be9dc62483902b6b2df226c0","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/commits/66a3723cbb1d2224be9dc62483902b6b2df226c0/comments","author":{"login":"bircni","id":75789103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1Nzg5MTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75789103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni","html_url":"https://github.com/bircni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bircni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"h